ima di iniziare la Missione 0, fotografiamo il vostro punto di partenza.","","1. Apri il passaporto digitale allegato (è una tua copia).","2. Per ogni riga metti una X in UNA sola colonna della parte PRIMA:","   rosso = ho bisogno di aiuto · giallo = riesco con una guida · verde = riesco da solo · blu = riesco e posso aiutare un compagno.","3. Sii sincero: non è un voto, serve a te e al prof per capire da dove partiamo.","4. Lascia vuote le colonne DOPO: le compilerai alla fine della missione.","5. Premi CONSEGNA.\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003epre\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ebutton\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ecp\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003edata-target\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ed00\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eCopia\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ebutton\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003estep\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;