an class=pl-s\u003ecopyrow\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003elbl\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eIstruzioni\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003epre\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ecopybox\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eid\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ed06\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eMissione 0 – Lezione 4 – Parte B (si fa per prima). Nella casella di Officina 23 sono arrivati diversi messaggi: alcuni potrebbero essere truffe.","","1. Apri la casella di posta simulata: \u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ea\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003ehref\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ehttps://digital-makers-ag.github.io/attivita-informatica-scuola/04_LEZIONE_4/MATERIALI/posta_officina23.html\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003etarget\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003e_blank\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003erel\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003enoopener\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003ehttps://digital-makers-ag.github.io/attivita-informatica-scuola/04_LEZIONE_4/MATERIALI/posta_officina23.html\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ea\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e (se non si apre, scarica posta_officina23.html e aprilo con doppio clic).","2. Per ogni messaggio: controlla il mittente completo (clic sul nome) e l\u0026amp;#x27;indirizzo vero dei link (mouse sopra, SENZA cliccare).","3. In fondo a ogni messaggio scegli «È affidabile» o «È phishing»; nella scheda scrivi indizi e come verificheresti.","4. Premi «★ Riepilogo e codice» e incolla il codice O23-PHI nella scheda e nel Modulo «Missione 0 · codici risultato».","5. Nella tua Gmail trova il comando \u0026amp;quot;Segnala phishing\u0026amp;quot; e incolla lo screenshot nella scheda.","6. Premi CONSEGNA.\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003epre\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ebutton\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ecp\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003edata-target\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ed06\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eCopia\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ebutton\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003e