pan\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eid\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ed07\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eMissione 0 – Lezione 4 – Parte A. La Tipografia Lampo aspetta i file per i volantini. Oggi il prof fa la parte della tipografia: la tua email arriverà davvero a lui.","","1. Apri la scheda di lavoro (tua copia).","2. Regola di oggi: allegati al massimo 20 MB in totale. Decidi cosa allegare e cosa mandare con un link di Drive.","3. Prepara la cartella in Drive: la tipografia deve vedere, non modificare. Il video non scaricarlo: fanne una copia in Drive.","4. Fai controllare la bozza a un compagno con la checklist, poi invia l\u0026amp;#x27;email all\u0026amp;#x27;indirizzo del prof.","5. NON allegare la cartella a questa consegna: premi solo CONSEGNA.\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003epre\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ebutton\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ecp\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot; \u003cspan class=pl-c1\u003edata-target\u003c/span\u003e=\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-s\u003ed07\u003c/span\u003e\u0026quot;\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eCopia\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ebutton\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-kos\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=pl-ent\u003ediv\u00