<div id="LC51" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>grid3</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>card</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>h4</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>🎯 L&#39;obiettivo<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>h4</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>p</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Riportare gli studenti a usare con sicurezza e in autonomia tastiera, file, documenti, ricerca, immagini, Drive, Gmail e sicurezza. Niente verifiche né quiz: si osserva ciò che producono (file, link, email).<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>p</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
<div id="LC52" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>card</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>h4</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>🚲 Il filo conduttore<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>h4</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>p</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Un unico scenario: la chiavetta disordinata di Marta (L1), la scheda del noleggio da sistemare (L2), fonti e immagini (L3), i file alla tipografia e le email truffa (L4), la proposta per il Comune (missione finale).<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>p</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
