ul</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>a</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>try</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>href</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>01_LEZIONE_1/MATERIALI/typing_officina23.html</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>target</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>_blank</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>rel</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>noopener</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>▶ Prova: Palestra della tastiera<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>a</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>a</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>try</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>href</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>01_LEZIONE_1/MATERIALI/scorciatoie_officina23.html</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>target</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>_blank</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>rel</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>noopener</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>▶ Prova: Palestra delle scorciatoie<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>a</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
