<div id="LC76" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copyrow</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>lbl</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Titolo<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copybox</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>id</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>t00</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Missione 0 · 00 · Il mio passaporto digitale (PRIMA)<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>button</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>cp</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>data-target</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>t00</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Copia<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>button</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
<div id="LC77" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copyrow</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>lbl</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Istruzioni<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>pre</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copybox</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>id</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>d00</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Benvenuti in Officina 23! Prima di iniziare la Missione 0, fotografiamo il vostro punto di partenza.</div>
<div id="LC78" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">
</div>
<div id="LC79" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">1. Apri il passaporto digitale allegato (è una tua copia).</div>
<div id="LC80" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">2. Per ogni riga metti una X in UNA sola colonna della parte PRIMA:</div>
<div id="LC81" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">   rosso = ho bisogno di aiuto · giallo = riesco con una guida · verde = riesco da solo · blu = riesco e posso aiutare un compagno.</div>
<div id="LC82" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">3. Sii sincero: non è un voto, serve a te e al prof per capire da dove partiamo.</div>
<div id="LC83" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">4. Lascia vuote le colonne DOPO: le compilerai alla fine della missione.</div>
