<div id="LC171" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">1. Apri la scheda di lavoro (tua copia). Lavorate in coppia per le misure.</div>
<div id="LC172" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">2. Scarica ed estrai immagini_confronto.zip e immagini_candidate_volantino.zip.</div>
<div id="LC173" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">3. Crea il documento test_trasparenza_cognome e allegalo alla consegna (Aggiungi o crea &amp;gt; Google Drive).</div>
<div id="LC174" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">4. Ricorda: Google Immagini trova le immagini, ma non è il proprietario.</div>
<div id="LC175" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">5. Premi CONSEGNA.<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>pre</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>button</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>cp</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>data-target</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>d05</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Copia<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>button</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>step</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>sn</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>2<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>sb</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>h4</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Allega questi file<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>h4</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
