num</span>&#39;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>30–47<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Compito 07 · pesa e decidi (demo ZIP del video)<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>tr</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>tr</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&#39;<span class=pl-s>num</span>&#39;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>47–79<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Drive e permessi · 3 casi<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>tr</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>tr</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&#39;<span class=pl-s>num</span>&#39;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>79–99<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Email alla tipografia con controllo del compagno<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>tr</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>tr</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>td</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&#39;<span class=pl-s>num</span>&#39;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>99–120<span class=pl