<div id="LC187" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>p</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>small</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Lavori del corso › <span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>+ Crea<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span> › <span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Compito<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span> · Punti: <span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Senza voto<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span> · Argomento: <span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Missione 0 – Officina 23<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>b</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span> · Scadenza: fine lezione<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>p</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
<div id="LC188" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copyrow</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>lbl</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Titolo<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copybox</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>id</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>t06</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Missione 0 · 06 · Casella sotto attacco (phishing)<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>button</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>cp</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>data-target</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>t06</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Copia<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>button</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span></div>
<div id="LC189" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div "><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copyrow</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>lbl</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Istruzioni<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>div</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span><span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>pre</span> <span class=pl-c1>class</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>copybox</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>id</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>d06</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>Missione 0 – Lezione 4 – Parte B (si fa per prima). Nella casella di Officina 23 sono arrivati diversi messaggi: alcuni potrebbero essere truffe.</div>
<div id="LC190" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">
</div>
<div id="LC191" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">1. Apri la casella di posta simulata: <span class=pl-kos>&lt;</span><span class=pl-ent>a</span> <span class=pl-c1>href</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>https://digital-makers-ag.github.io/attivita-informatica-scuola/04_LEZIONE_4/MATERIALI/posta_officina23.html</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>target</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>_blank</span>&quot; <span class=pl-c1>rel</span>=&quot;<span class=pl-s>noopener</span>&quot;<span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span>https://digital-makers-ag.github.io/attivita-informatica-scuola/04_LEZIONE_4/MATERIALI/posta_officina23.html<span class=pl-kos>&lt;/</span><span class=pl-ent>a</span><span class=pl-kos>&gt;</span> (se non si apre, scarica posta_officina23.html e aprilo con doppio clic).</div>
<div id="LC192" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">2. Per ogni messaggio: controlla il mittente completo (clic sul nome) e l&amp;#x27;indirizzo vero dei link (mouse sopra, SENZA cliccare).</div>
<div id="LC193" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">3. In fondo a ogni messaggio scegli «È affidabile» o «È phishing»; nella scheda scrivi indizi e come verificheresti.</div>
<div id="LC194" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">4. Premi «★ Riepilogo e codice» e incolla il codice O23-PHI nella scheda e nel Modulo «Missione 0 · codici risultato».</div>
<div id="LC195" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">5. Nella tua Gmail trova il comando &amp;quot;Segnala phishing&amp;quot; e incolla lo screenshot nella scheda.</div>
